  "aboutContent": "Campus.Async is an unofficial, community-driven student platform initiated during the pandemic. It connects students across universities worldwide for academic discussions, homework help, and social activities.\n\nThis is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or officially connected to any university. All school names and logos are used solely for identification purposes.\n\nThrough decentralized, open collaboration, Campus.Async aims to bridge the gap between students of different institutions — fostering cross-campus friendships, knowledge sharing, and event coordination.\n\nOur long-term vision is to become a global student association similar to Rotaract Clubs, uniting young adults across institutions through technology.",
